BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Littoralicious//Terroir Vienna//EN
X-WR-CALNAME:Vienna — eat & drink checklist
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-1@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Wiener Schnitzel vom Kalb — A breaded\, fried veal cutlet\; ask for Kalb\, veal\, and check the menu says so.
DESCRIPTION:Say: VEE-ner SHNIT-sel fomm KALP. Figlmüller bills itself as the home of the original\; the Milan origin story is on the legends card. Best: Figlmüller\, Wollzeile 5
LOCATION:Figlmüller\, Wollzeile 5
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Figlm%C3%BCller+Wollzeile+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-2@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Tafelspitz — Boiled beef served with broth\, apple-horseradish and chive sauce.
DESCRIPTION:Say: TAH-fel-shpits. Plachutta serves it in the pot at the table\; ask which cut. Best: Plachutta\, Wollzeile 38
LOCATION:Plachutta\, Wollzeile 38
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Plachutta+Wollzeile+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-3@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Gebackene Fledermaus — Fried beef with a potato and lamb's-lettuce salad.
DESCRIPTION:Say: geh-BACK-eh-neh FLAY-der-mouse. A Beisl cut seldom seen elsewhere\, €19.50 on the printed menu. Best: Gasthaus Pöschl\, Weihburggasse 17
LOCATION:Gasthaus Pöschl\, Weihburggasse 17
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gasthaus+P%C3%B6schl+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-4@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Original Sachertorte — The Sacher cake\, cut in the hotel café.
DESCRIPTION:Say: ZAH-kher-TOR-teh. The recipe is secret\; about a third of 360\,000 hand-made tortes a year are eaten on the premises. Best: Café Sacher\, Philharmonikerstraße 4
LOCATION:Café Sacher\, Philharmonikerstraße 4
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Caf%C3%A9+Sacher+Wien+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-5@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Eduard-Sacher-Torte — Demel's cake\, sold under the name the 1963 settlement left it.
DESCRIPTION:Say: AY-doo-ART ZAH-kher-TOR-teh. The other side of the Sachertorte argument\, with a single layer of jam. Best: Demel\, Kohlmarkt 14
LOCATION:Demel\, Kohlmarkt 14
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Demel+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-6@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Kaiserschmarrn — The emperor's pancake\, served hot.
DESCRIPTION:Say: KY-zer-SHMAR-n. Demel makes it daily\; whose emperor it was is argued under Cake. Best: Demel\, Kohlmarkt 14
LOCATION:Demel\, Kohlmarkt 14
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Demel+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-7@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Melange — Milk coffee in the Viennese style\, with the glass of water on the tray.
DESCRIPTION:Say: meh-LAHNZH. The coffee-house order\; the table comes with it. Best: Café Sperl\, Gumpendorfer Straße 11
LOCATION:Café Sperl\, Gumpendorfer Straße 11
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Caf%C3%A9+Sperl+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-8@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Buchteln — Jam-filled yeast buns.
DESCRIPTION:Say: BOOKH-teln. The Vienna Tourist Board names them as Hawelka's famous dish. Best: Café Hawelka\, Dorotheergasse 6
LOCATION:Café Hawelka\, Dorotheergasse 6
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Caf%C3%A9+Hawelka+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-9@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Käsekrainer — A lightly smoked pork sausage with 10 to 20 percent cheese.
DESCRIPTION:Say: KAY-zeh-KRY-ner. An Austrian invention\, per wien.info\, sold at every stand. Best: Bitzinger\, Albertinaplatz
LOCATION:Bitzinger\, Albertinaplatz
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bitzinger+W%C3%BCrstelstand+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-10@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Süß oder scharf? — The stand's one question: sweet Kremser mustard or hot tarragon mustard.
DESCRIPTION:Say: ZEWSS OH-der SHARF. Answer it with the sausage\; carry cash. Best: Alles Wurscht\, Börseplatz 1
LOCATION:Alles Wurscht\, Börseplatz 1
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Alles+Wurscht+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-11@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Wiener Gemischter Satz\, a Viertel — A white field blend\; order a Viertel\, a quarter litre.
DESCRIPTION:Say: VEE-ner geh-MISH-ter ZATS. Vienna's own wine\, planted\, picked and pressed together. Best: Mayer am Pfarrplatz\, Heiligenstadt
LOCATION:Mayer am Pfarrplatz\, Heiligenstadt
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mayer+am+Pfarrplatz+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-12@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Sturm — Partly fermented grape must\, cloudy and still fermenting\; drink it within days.
DESCRIPTION:Say: SHTOORM. The drink of October\; the Stürmische Tage in Stammersdorf are its festival. Best: Heuriger Wieninger\, Stammersdorf
LOCATION:Heuriger Wieninger\, Stammersdorf
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Heuriger+Wieninger+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-13@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Martinigansl — St Martin's goose with red cabbage and dumplings.
DESCRIPTION:Say: mar-TEE-nee-GAN-sl. On the cards around 11 November\; Gansl-Zeit at Gasthaus Wild runs 6–22 November. Best: Gasthaus Wild\, Radetzkyplatz 1
LOCATION:Gasthaus Wild\, Radetzkyplatz 1
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gasthaus+Wild+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-14@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Trześniewski with a Pfiff — Tiny open sandwiches\, 27 toppings\, and a Pfiff\, one-eighth of a litre of beer.
DESCRIPTION:Say: trzhesh-NYEF-skee\, PFIFF. About 5\,000 canapés a day\, spreads still applied by hand with a fork. Best: Trześniewski\, Dorotheergasse 1
LOCATION:Trześniewski\, Dorotheergasse 1
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Trze%C5%9Bniewski+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-15@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Karpfen wie gewachsen — Carp cut whole and fried\, or pan-fried Serbian style.
DESCRIPTION:Say: KARP-fen vee geh-VAKH-sen. The Viennese river fish\, on the one verified river-fish card on the lake. Best: Gasthaus Birner\, Obere Alte Donau
LOCATION:Gasthaus Birner\, Obere Alte Donau
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gasthaus+Birner+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-16@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Zanderfilet — Pike-perch fillet\, here with clams.
DESCRIPTION:Say: TSAN-der-fi-LAY. A modern plate on the Donaukanal with the canal traffic outside. Best: Motto am Fluss\, Franz-Josefs-Kai 2
LOCATION:Motto am Fluss\, Franz-Josefs-Kai 2
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Motto+am+Fluss+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-17@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Unfiltered house beer — Beer brewed three times a week on Vienna spring water\, slightly cloudy with yeast.
DESCRIPTION:Next to a Brennerei that distils spirits from its own beers. Best: Salm Bräu\, Rennweg 8
LOCATION:Salm Bräu\, Rennweg 8
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Salm+Br%C3%A4u+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-18@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:The bread trolley — Bread from a trolley at the table\, beside a cheese trolley.
DESCRIPTION:What the MICHELIN Inspector singles out at Vienna's flagship house. Best: Steirereck\, Am Heumarkt 2a
LOCATION:Steirereck\, Am Heumarkt 2a
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Steirereck+im+Stadtpark+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-19@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Calamari carbonara — A pasta-free carbonara of calamari\, smoked eel and Parmesan.
DESCRIPTION:A dish a sea cook can take home: the carbonara idea built on squid. Best: Pramerl & the Wolf\, Pramergasse 21
LOCATION:Pramerl & the Wolf\, Pramergasse 21
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pramerl+%26+the+Wolf+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-20@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Apple strudel\, stretched in front of you — Court confectioners stretch the dough and bake an apple strudel as you watch.
DESCRIPTION:Say: AP-fel-SHTROO-del. €19.90 with a hot drink\; four shows a day. Best: Gerstner\, Schloss Schönbrunn
LOCATION:Gerstner\, Schloss Schönbrunn
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Gerstner+Schloss+Sch%C3%B6nbrunn+Wien
END:VTODO
BEGIN:VTODO
UID:vienna-liste-21@littoralicious.com
SUMMARY:Grüner Veltliner Federspiel — The middle rung of the Wachau ladder.
DESCRIPTION:Say: GREW-ner FELT-lee-ner FAY-der-shpeel. The cooperative's counter lets you taste all three rungs side by side. Best: Domäne Wachau\, Dürnstein 107
LOCATION:Domäne Wachau\, Dürnstein 107
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dom%C3%A4ne+Wachau+D%C3%BCrnstein
END:VTODO
END:VCALENDAR
